    silent.cc UI Framework
    Top-Navbar Dual-Column Architecture (Expanded Geometry & Pure LayoutOrder)
    Updates:
    - Removed minimize (_) and close (X) buttons for clean minimalistic header
    - Expanded window geometry (680x720) for optimal spacing
    - Fixed element ordering: strictly uses LayoutOrder instead of alphabetical sort
]]

